  received length(15) is not ok: "0123456789123456"

Check the reason:
   The DMA interrupt ended prematurely within the serial port idle interrupt, potentially leading to incomplete DMA transmission. Subsequently, when receiving data in the serial port idle interrupt callback function, the last byte was lost.

