[samuelpowell - 2026-01-16T19:56:29Z]
Hello @MKISTM 

I understand if you are unable to examine this without an MWE, but I am not in a position to provide that at present. I can give a little more detail though.

Consider the case that a 2D DMA transfer has been configured (perhaps via CubeMX) and set up using the HAL library, e.g.,


    /* SPI2 DMA Init */
    /* GPDMA1_REQUEST_SPI2_RX Init */
    handle_GPDMA1_Channel12.Instance = GPDMA1_Channel12;
